# Upload rules for `gcloud run deploy --source` (Cloud Build context).
#
# WITHOUT this file gcloud falls back to .gitignore — which lists `uv.lock`
# (line 18), so the lockfile would be excluded and the Dockerfile's
# `COPY ... uv.lock ...` fails. This file overrides that: it excludes only the
# heavy/irrelevant stuff and keeps everything the image build needs
# (pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, src/).

.git/
.github/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
node_modules/
